8-1affff0ec02d.png","line":60,"embedded":true},{"title":"Sun Valley Allen 2022","target":"https://boisedev.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/tim-cook.png","line":68,"embedded":true},{"title":"BoiseDev House - OTT - Commercial","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/8b916803-64e1-4279-a378-7e47d28a2871.png","line":76,"embedded":true},{"title":"BoiseDev House - OTT - Commercial","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/8b916803-64e1-4279-a378-7e47d28a2871.png","line":86,"embedded":true},{"title":"Washington Trust Bank - 2:1 - B","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/7e2d1d9d-6709-42d2-b854-beae3d2debe1.png","line":96,"embedded":true},{"title":"Idaho Mountain Express","target":"https://www.mtexpress.com/","line":102}],"metadata":{"title":"Billionaires, buyouts, and backlash: Annual Allen and Co. conference starts in Sun Valley","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/07/07/billionaires-buyouts-and-backlash-annual-allen-and-co-conference-starts-in-sun-valley/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=simpson-supports-h-2a-overhaul-stegner-launches-run-for-governor-column-higher-ed-cuts-hurt-idaho&_bhlid=832d4b9d2b761e345eeb0ed074cb4a6fc7f2b36e","author":["[[Andrew Theophilus - Idaho Mountain Express Staff Writer]]"],"published":"2026-07-07","created":"2026-07-08","description":"The exclusive annual Allen & Co. conference held at Sun Valley Resort is set to begin today, welcoming top media and technology executives as well as prominent journalists. The invite-only conference, sometimes called a “summer camp for billionaires,” provides its attendees with opportunities to explore the Sun Valley area through outdoor recreation while networking. Friedman […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},